Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.10,0:02:38.37,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为这就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.Right about there. I think that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不敢相信我们竟然买了这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}l can't believe we actually bought this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以说慈善拍卖能举行开幕酒会是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason charity auctions have an open bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不觉得… 这画有点让人觉得毛骨悚然吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think, I don't know, it's kind of creepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的 我来保障你的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'll keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许你才是那个我应该觉得害怕的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're the one I ought to be scared of?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.21,0:00:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们上楼去吧 - 给我10分钟来锁门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go upstairs. - Give me two minutes to lock up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我1分钟好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.77,0:01:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要是不快点的话 我就自己先开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't hurry up.I'm gonna start without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.37,0:02:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 开下灯 我看不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe, get the lights.I can't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.22,0:02:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有闻到什么味道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spill something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.59,0:02:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ann?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ann!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}7 4 2 0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven, four, two, zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}7 4 2 0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven, four, two, zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.91,0:02:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 已经存进去了 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you're in there. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的名字是以「Y」结尾还是以「I」结尾的Brandy？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is "Brandy" with a Y or an I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 我得走了 别走开 我等下就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen, I gotta go. Hold that.thought. l'll be right back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我想我查到了一些什么 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. So I think I got something. - Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我们该歇会了 就一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we need to take.a little shore leave, just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.17,0:03:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得怎样？我和那边那个正打得火热\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, huh?I'm so in the door with this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们今天是什么身份 迪恩？摇滚明星吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we today, Dean? Are we rock stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是什么特种部队？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we Army Rangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是L。-A的星探 来找有特殊才艺的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reality-TV scouts looking for people.with special skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还不是那么离谱 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hey, it's notthat far off, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便说句 她还有个朋友也在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way.She's got a friend over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以介绍你们认识 你觉得怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably hook you up. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 还是不必了 我可以自己去找约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks. I can get my own dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 你是可以 可是你根本没去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you can, but you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你这话什么意思？- 没什么意思 你查到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that supposed to mean? - Nothing. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几天前纽约纽柏兹的马克和安·特莱斯卡夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark and Ann Telesca of New Paltz, New York…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被发现陈尸家中\N{\fnArial\fs30}were both found dead in their home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喉咙被切开 现场没有任何指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throats were slit. There were no prints.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:03:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没发现凶器 所有的 迪恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}no murder weapons, all-Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.85,0:04:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没发现指纹和凶器 所有的门窗都从里面上锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No prints, no murder weapons, all doors and windows locked from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能只是普通的谋杀案而已 你知道 不是我们该管的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could just be a garden-variety murder, not our department.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 爸爸可不那么觉得 - 什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Dad says different. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看 爸爸有注意到发生在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Dad noted three murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.87,0:04:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纽约郊区同一地带的三起谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the same area of upstate New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一起在这 1912年 第二起是1945年\N{\fnArial\fs30}First one right here, 1912, the second one in 1945…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.40,0:04:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第三起是1970年 和特莱斯卡夫妇一样的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the third in 1970, the same m.o. as the Telescas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喉咙被切开 房子都从里面上锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The throats were slit, the houses were locked from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几起谋杀案之间隔了那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time passed between the murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.05,0:04:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能除了爸爸之外没人注意到这种相似性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody tracked the pattern but Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一直在注意看有没其他相似的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept his eyes peeled for another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们现在找到一个了- 正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And now we got one? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.43,0:04:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意 这事值得去看下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, l'm with you.It's worth checking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是总不能现在就启程去 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't pick this up till first thing, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 对- 那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 女士们 有没想我啊？- 迪恩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Ladies. Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 玩笑而已 - 我只是一个小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hell, yeah. - l'm just kid-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和制片人谈过了 事情进展的很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I talked to my producer, and it is looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}酷极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.15,0:05:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 这一点都不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that's so not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我用EMF把特莱斯卡的房子扫视过一遍 没什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just swept the Telesca house with the EMF. It's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 而昨天晚上当你… 出去… - 噢 很尽兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And last night, while you were out… - Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我查过了这所房子的历史记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}l checked the history of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有灵异事件 没有暴力犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hauntings, no violent crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于特莱斯卡一家也没什么奇怪的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing strange about the Telescas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么要是不是人和房子的问题的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if it's not the people, and it's not the house…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许是里面的摆设 带有诅咒的物品或是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, uh, maybe it's the contents, a cursed object.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 房子没有问题 - 你说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- House is clean. - Yeah, I know, you said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我是说里面已经空了 什么家具也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean it's empty.No furniture or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那所有的东西都哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's all their stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}默拍 财产出售\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consignment auctions, estate sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这看起来就象是专门为W。-A。-S。-P。-S举行的旧物出售\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a garage sale for Wasps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你问我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么能效劳的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能来杯香槟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like some champagne, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是侍应生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是萨姆·康纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam Connors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位是我大哥迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my brother, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是来自Connors Limited的艺术经销商\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are art dealers, with Connors Limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你们是艺术经销商？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're art dealers? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是丹尼尔·布莱克 这里是我开的拍卖行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Daniel Blake.This is my auction house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天是个私人的展览\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, gentlemen, this is a private showing…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得贵宾名单上没有你们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't remember seeing you on the guest list.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们名字在上面 你去再看下就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're there, Chuckles, just need to take another look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 终于来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Finally. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美国原始派艺术的代表作 你们觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fine example of American primitive, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得比起摩西奶奶 更象是格兰特·伍德的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, l'd say it's more Grant Wood than Grandma Moses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经知道了 你只是在试探我知不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you knew that.You just wanted to see if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是惭愧 开个玩笑 我道歉 我是莎拉·布莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty. And clumsy. I apologize.I'm Sarah Blake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是萨姆 这是我大哥迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam. This is my brother, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 要不要再多给你拿点小曲奇饼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Can we get you some more mini-quiche?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不用了 谢谢 - 有什么能效劳的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mm-mm. I'm good. Thanks. - So can I help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上有 能不能和我们说下特莱斯卡的财产的事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, actually. Um, what can you tell us about the Telesca estate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你问我的话 我觉得这么快就\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole thing's pretty grisly, if you ask me…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卖掉他们的东西实在不敬 可是我父亲有句话说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}selling their things this soon, but Dad's right about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.63,0:07:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种煽情主义才会带来大量的客人 甚至是很有钱的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensationalism brings out the crowds.Even the rich ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能不能让我们看下这些东西的出处？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls it possible to see the provenances?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想可能不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm afraid there isn't any chance of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为什么？- 你们并没有在贵宾名单上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - You're not on the guest list.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们该离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们没必要被两次告诫 - 很显然 你们就是要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, we don't have to be told twice. - Apparently, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.51,0:08:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好 就这样 我们可不想惹麻烦 我们就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It's all right.We don't want any trouble. We'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 那样真粗鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, that was rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么玩意？艺术历史课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grant Wood Grandma Moses?Art history course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那课很好认识女孩子 - 好象我从不认识你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's good for meeting girls. - It's like I don't even know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那「Providence」是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what was the providence?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.37,0:08:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一种出处的证明书 就象传记一样 懂吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a certificate of origin, like a biography.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以用它们来追溯物品的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can use them to track the pieces'history.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看是不是有什么不寻常的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if any has got a freaky past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们从那老家伙口中可套不出什么来 可是莎拉… 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're not getting anything out of Chuckles, but, uh, Sarah…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你可以叫她写在你的餐巾上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can get her to write it all on a cocktail napkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 钓女孩子是你的专长 迪恩 - 她当时看的可不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pickups are your thing, Dean. - lt wasn't my butt she was checking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你是叫我利用她来套话\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other words, you want me to use her to get information.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时候为了大局是要牺牲下 打给她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you gotta take one for the team. Call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 地方不错 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice place. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 很高兴你打给我 虽然很讶异不过还是很高兴 - 真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glad you called. Surprised, but glad. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.76,0:09:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过听上去你好象想了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although you seemed to have a hard time getting out the words:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才挤出「你愿意和我共进晚餐？」几个字来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Would you like to have dinner?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 我已经很久没约过人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I haven't really been on a date in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我也一样 - 你开玩笑吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome to the club. - You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:09:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好了 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}酒单\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wine list.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道我们的男主角要什么不过我点一杯啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about Romeo here, but I'll have a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.41,0:10:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make that two.Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 所以你上学时学的是艺术对吧？- 没错 我是个艺术家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you studied art in school, huh?It's true. I was an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.25,0:10:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个很糟糕的艺术家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A terrible, terrible artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 所以现在才会从事拍卖业 你在读法律预科？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's why I'm in the auction business.And you were pre-law? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是你并没去上法学院 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't go to law school.How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.93,0:10:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it's a really long story for another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和我以前遇见过的艺术经销商不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not like any art dealer I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说你也很长一段时间没约会了 是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did you mean when you said you hadn't been on a date in a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:11:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 想让我觉得我并不是很逊色？- 那句话有很多意思 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Making me feel like l'm not a loser? - l'm sure you're many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能确定「逊色」并不是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm also sure loser isn't one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是因为我的母亲 她大概一年前去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my mom.She died about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无预警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.42,0:11:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我伤心欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really threw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把自己封闭起来 封闭在一个温暖安全的环境里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went into this shell.A nice, warm, safe shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.94,0:11:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是后来 我想了很久… 这并不是她希望看到的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}But lately l've been thinking, it's not what she would have wanted for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你呢？你算是个很有魅力的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what about you?You're a reasonably attractive guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 算是 - 你为什么不去约会？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reasonably. - Why haven't you been out and about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又是说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another long story for another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以她只是爽快的把「Providences」给你了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she just handed the providences over to you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.35,0:12:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是Provenances - Provenances\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Provenances. - Provenances?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 我们回到她的住处 拿了一份文件的复印件\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yes, we went back to her place, I got a copy of the papers…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 然后呢？- 没了 就这样 我就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - And nothing. That's it. I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.65,0:12:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没必要只是骗骗她 你可以做点其他特殊的事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to con her or do any special favors or anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能不能不要整天想那些龌龊的事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, would you get your mind out of the gutter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等事情完结之后 我们可以在这地方稍微滞留一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this thing's done, we could stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为什么？- 方便你再叫她出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - So you could take her out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很显然你对她有感觉 我都能看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's obvious you're into her. I see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 我找到点资料了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I think I got something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.17,0:12:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「以赛亚商人一家的肖像画 绘于1910年」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Portrait of Isaiah Merchant's family, painted 1910."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把买主和爸爸日记上的名字对比下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, compare the names of the owners with Dad's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.89,0:12:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「1912年由彼得·西姆斯第一次购得」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"First purchased in 1912 to Peter Simms."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.98,0:12:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得·西姆斯于1912年被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Peter Simms murdered in 1912."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.15,0:13:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同样的事情发生在1945年 还有1970年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing in 1945.Oh, same thing in 1970.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后画就被存起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then stored.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到上个月才被捐献给一个慈善拍卖会\N{\fnArial\fs30}until it was donated to a charity auction last month…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.84,0:13:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里特莱斯卡买下了这副画\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the Telescas bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你觉得是什么？被鬼魂附上了还是被诅咒了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think, it's haunted or cursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管是什么 问题肯定出在画身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, it's toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.95,0:13:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.11,0:14:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丑陋的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugly-ass thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你问我的话 我们在帮艺术世界清除异类\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask me, we're doing the art world a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 糟糕 我找不到我钱包了 - 没什么问题吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got a problem. I can't find my wallet. - How is that my problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我昨晚掉在拍卖行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I think I dropped it in the warehouse last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在开玩笑对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上面有我的指纹 我的身份证 虽然是我的假身份证\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean, it's got my prints, my ID-Well, my fake lD,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no matter how.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.64,0:15:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还是要得在别人找到前 把钱包找回来 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we gotta get it before somebody else finds it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你钱包怎么会丢 迪恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you lose your wallet, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 - 莎拉 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, guys. - Sarah. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.99,0:15:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在这干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们 我们要走了 所以过来道别的。-\N{\fnArial\fs30}We-We are leaving town. And, you know, we came to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说什么 萨姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what are you talking about, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们至少还得待个一两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sticking around for at least another day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 正好 我还得还你之前欠你的20美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, by the way, l'm gonna go ahead and give you that 20 bucks I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我老忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always forget, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.57,0:15:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我就不陪你们小俩口了 我得去… 那儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, l'll leave you two crazy kids alone.I gotta go do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那么… - 我昨晚过得很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So. - I had a good time last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没错 我也是 - 也许有时间可以再一起出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Yeah, I did too. - Maybe we should do it again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很乐意 真的 可是迪恩 刚刚只是在胡说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'd love to, I really would, but Dean, he was just screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们今天真的得走了 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We really are taking off today. - Oh. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这太糟了 - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, that's too bad. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么？- 那\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那幅画… 看起来真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That painting looks so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你是说它有另类的美的话 那可能你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can call that monstrosity good, then, yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莎拉 那幅画你知道些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah.What do you know about that painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.75,0:16:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不太了解 只是觉得它给我毛骨悚然的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much, just that it creeps me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们那天在慈善拍卖上卖给了特莱斯卡夫妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sold it to the Telescas at a charity auction the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.22,0:16:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后来他们就被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以现在你们打算再次出售吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're just gonna sell it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父亲是有这个打算 不过我会阻止他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as my dad wants to, no, I won't let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我觉得这幅画不怎么样 - 那太好了 千万别卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think it'd be in bad taste. - Good. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}答应我千万不要卖了 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?Make sure you don't, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？别告诉我你对那画有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Don't tell me you're interested in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然不是 才不可能会想买 我得走了 我还有事要办\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. God, no. Not in buying it, no.You know what? I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.91,0:17:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会再找你的 我再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta take care of something.But I will call you back. I will call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.18,0:17:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 待会见 - 等会 所以你今晚不离开了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'll see you later. - Wait, so you're not leaving tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是的 稍后再联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I guess not. l'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.74,0:17:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真搞不懂 迪恩 我们明明把那鬼玩意给烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand, Dean.We burned the damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.47,0:17:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是谢谢了 自以为是的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, thank you, Captain Obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.84,0:17:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 我们得另外找方法来对付它\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we just need to figure out another way to get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么想法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.05,0:17:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好 几乎所有的被鬼附上的油画的传说中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right. Well, um, in almost all the lore about haunted paintings…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}往往是画中的主题附上了油画\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's always the painting's subject that haunts them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.85,0:17:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对吧？所以我们得设法搞清楚那幅鬼画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? We need to figure out everything there is to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.02,0:17:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}画的鬼家庭的所有事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}about that creepy-ass family in that creepy-ass painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们叫什么名字来着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were their names again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 以赛亚商人一家 对吧？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said the lsaiah Merchant family? - Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.81,0:17:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我查了所有的当地历史宗卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dug up every scrap of local history I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 所以你们是什么犯罪爱好者对吧？- 差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, uh, are you boys crime buffs? - Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.95,0:18:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为什么这么问？- 看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Why do you ask? - Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.33,0:18:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没错 这样就说的通了 - 全家都被杀死了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. Yeah, that sounds about right. - The whole family was killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎是以赛亚先割破了所有孩子的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems this Isaiah, he slits his kids' throats…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后是他妻子 最后是他自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}then his wife, then himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个理发师 用的是把直剃须刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he was a barber by trade.Used a straight razor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.15,0:18:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他为什么这么做？- 我们一起来看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why did he do it? - Well, let's look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「认识他的人都形容以赛亚 脾气易暴易躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}"People who knew him described Isaiah as having stern and harsh temperament.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.64,0:18:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对自己的家人也喜欢动用暴力「 对他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Controlled his family with an iron fist.Wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两个儿子和一个收养的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}two sons, a dopted daughter."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时有传言说他妻子打算带着孩子离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were whispers that the wife was gonna take the kids and leave-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.27,0:18:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在当时的那个年代想想也是理所当然的事情…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, which, of course, you know, in that day and age…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以老以赛亚索性给他们全体来了次割喉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so instead, old man Isaiah, well, he gave them all a shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.77,0:18:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 上面有没提及尸体后来怎样了？- 全都被火化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say what happened to the bodies? - Just that they were all cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 还有别的吗？- 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything else? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.27,0:19:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我找到了一张他们全家的合照 就在这本书的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I found a picture of the family.It's right here, somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们能不能复印一份？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could we get a copy of this, please? - Hmm. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸… 你答应过我不卖这幅画的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you promised you wouldn't sell that painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得 亲爱的 可是伊夫林开出了一个可观的价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, sweetie, but Evelyn's offered a persuasive amount of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样做真应该感到羞愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're shameless, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了那笔可观的钱 我宁愿被那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that kind of money, I can afford to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.21,0:19:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我很确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, man, l'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拍卖行的画像里 画中的父亲是向下看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Painting at the auction house, Dad is looking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.68,0:19:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这张画里 父亲是向外看 画像改变了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Painting here, Dad's looking out.The painting has changed, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.17,0:19:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你觉得父亲被困在这幅画里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Daddy Dearest is in the painting and handing out…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.24,0:19:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后他再象对待他家人一样 对待买这幅画的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Columbian neckties like with his family?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 看起来事情就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it seems like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是要是连他的尸骨都被火化了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if his bones are already dusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们该怎么阻止他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how are we gonna stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.77,0:19:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是画中Isaiah的位置都改变了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If lsaiah's position changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许画中其他什么地方也改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then maybe other things in the painting changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许从中可以找到什么线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it could give us some clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.99,0:20:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}象是「达芬奇密码」之类的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like a Da Vinci Code deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不清楚 我都还在等那部电影上映\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. l'm just still waiting for the movie on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎样 我们得回去再看下那幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, we gotta get back in and see that painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过这样也好 因为你就有更多时间和你女朋友相处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is good. You can get more time to crush on your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哥们… 够了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude, enough already. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？自从我们到这地方之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Ever since we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.09,0:20:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你都一直在试着撮合我和莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been trying to pimp me out to Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.05,0:20:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 别管这事了好吧？- 可是你喜欢她 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just back off, all right? - Well, you like her, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.01,0:20:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你喜欢她 她也喜欢你 你们都是成年人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like her, she likes you, you're consenting adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想说什么 迪恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.14,0:20:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会离开的 我们总会离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just leave. We always leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.81,0:20:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我又不是要让你和她结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saml'm not talking about marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真搞不懂 你为什么那么关心我的感情生活？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it. What do you care if I hook up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许你就不会一直那么暗自神伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because then maybe you wouldn't be so cranky all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.02,0:20:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说真的 萨姆 这不是只是你交不交女朋友的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, seriously, Sam, this isn't about just hooking up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得这个叫莎拉的女孩会对你有帮助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I think that this Sarah girl could be good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.55,0:20:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并不是有什么不敬的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't mean any disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.46,0:20:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是 我肯定所有的一切都是因为杰西卡 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm sure that this is about Jessica, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然我不能了解你失去挚爱是什么感觉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't know what it's like to lose somebody like that…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:21:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是… 我知道她也希望你能重新开心起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I would think that she would want you to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.34,0:21:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝也允许我们有时尽情享乐一下 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}God forbid, have fun once in a while.Wouldn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.18,0:21:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 我知道她也是那么希望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know she would.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的没错 有部分原因是因为杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right, part of this is about Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可是也不是全部 - 那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But not the main part. - What's it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还是得去看那幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still gotta see that painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.59,0:21:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你还是得打电话给莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means you still gotta call Sarah, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莎拉 嘿 我是萨姆 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, hey, it's Sam. Hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.19,0:21:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 很好 你怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Good, yeah.Um, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 很好 真的很好 - 真流利啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, good. Good, really good. - Smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.73,0:22:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我和我大哥想\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh… So listen, me and my brother were, uh, thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.02,0:22:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回你那去 再看看那幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}that maybe we'd like to come back in and look at the painting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我们可能想买下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe we are interested in buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么？你们卖给谁了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What? Who'd you sell it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莎拉 现在给我她的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, I need an address right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨姆 发生什么事了？- 我说过你没必要来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, what's happening? - I told you you shouldn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.01,0:23:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哈罗 有人在家吗？ - 你说伊芙琳可能有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. Anybody home? - You said Evelyn might be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么危险？- 打不开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What kind of danger? - I can't knock this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.88,0:23:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要撬开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta pick it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.15,0:23:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们到底是什么人 夜盗吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys, burglars?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.69,0:23:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也希望事情就这么简单 听着 你应该呆在车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wish it's that simple.You should wait in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.62,0:23:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 别出来 - 我当然不会 伊芙琳是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's for your own good. - The hell I will. Evelyn's a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.53,0:23:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊芙琳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.41,0:23:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊芙琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.38,0:23:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊芙琳？我是莎拉·布莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn? It's Sarah Blake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.17,0:23:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你没事吧？- 莎拉 别看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - Sarah, don't. Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.69,0:24:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.36,0:24:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.30,0:24:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.24,0:24:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.33,0:24:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚刚才向警察撒完谎说是我一个人冲进伊芙琳的家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}l just lied to the cops and told them I went to Evelyn's…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现她变成那样子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}alone and found her like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.34,0:24:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要谢我 要是你们不告诉我到底发生什么事了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. l'm about to call them…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.38,0:24:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我马上打电话叫警察回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you don't tell me what the hell's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.81,0:24:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底是谁杀死了这些人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's killing these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.37,0:24:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 「什么」- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "What."-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是 「谁」 是要问 「什么」杀死了这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not "who."It's "what" is killing those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.61,0:24:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莎拉 你看到那幅画动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, you saw that painting move.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 才没有 - 我是看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I was-l was seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.86,0:24:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不过那是不可能的 - 欢迎来到我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's impossible. - Yeah, well, welcome to our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.78,0:25:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莎拉 我知道这听起来很疯狂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, I know this sounds crazy…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.37,0:25:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是我们认为那幅画闹鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we think that that painting is haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.79,0:25:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在开玩笑对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.42,0:25:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.65,0:25:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 天啊 这就是我出去约会的对象 - 莎拉 你仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God. The guys I go out with. - Sarah, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.26,0:25:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊夫林 特莱斯卡夫妇 他们都买下了那幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn, the Telescas, they both had the painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.81,0:25:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之前也有这样的事情发生 只要这幅画走到什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there have been others.Wherever this thing goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.36,0:25:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就会有人死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}people die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.02,0:25:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们正在努力阻止这事情再发生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're just trying to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.31,0:25:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是事情的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.48,0:25:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你最好能证明给我看 我和你一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I guess you better show me. l'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.70,0:25:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？不行 莎拉 绝对不行 你最好还是先回家去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. Sarah, no.You should just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.95,0:25:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情会变得很危险的 而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stuff can get dangerous and…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.20,0:25:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我不想让你受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want you to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.08,0:25:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 你们可能只是疯子而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you guys are probably crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.67,0:25:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是要是你们说的是实话的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you're right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.79,0:25:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和我父亲卖掉那幅画的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, me and my dad sold that painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.51,0:25:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就可能做了他们被杀的帮凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might've got these people killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.63,0:25:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是说我不害怕 因为我知道我现在怕得要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying l'm not scared, because I am scared…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.22,0:26:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是我也不会选择就此逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}but l'm not gonna run and hide either.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.81,0:26:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以说我们一起去还是怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are we going or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.31,0:26:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.98,0:26:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}娶她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marry that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.24,0:26:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里现在不是犯罪现场吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, isn't this a crime scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.09,0:26:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你都已经向警察撒谎了 还怕什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you already lied to the cops.What's another infraction?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.51,0:26:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不怕这画现在就会杀人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you worried that it's gonna, you know, kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.63,0:26:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会 好象晚上才会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It seems to do its thing at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.60,0:26:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白天我们是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're all right in the daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.89,0:26:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 看看这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.19,0:26:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那把剃刀… 这张照片里是合上的 那幅画上却是打开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The razor, it's… Uh, It's closed. But it's open in that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.97,0:26:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你们在找什么？- 要是那鬼怪改变了画中的内容的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? - lf the spirit's changing aspects…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.60,0:27:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许它那样做是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the painting, maybe it's doing so for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.37,0:27:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 看这 画里做背景的那幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. Look at this.The painting in the painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.41,0:27:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来象一个地下室或陵墓之类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like a crypt or a mausoleum or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.89,0:27:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「默钱特」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Merchant."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是找过的第三个墓地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the third boneyard we've checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.40,0:27:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这鬼把我们耍得团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this ghost is jerking us around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.90,0:27:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们就靠这谋生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is what you guys do for a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.35,0:27:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确切来说不算 我们没酬劳可拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly. We don't get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.79,0:27:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, mazel tov.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.87,0:27:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我这辈子看过的最可怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That, right there, is the creepiest thing I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.33,0:28:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是当时的一种传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, uh, sort of a tradition at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.02,0:28:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有孩子夭折的时候 有时候他们会把那孩子最爱的玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever a child died, sometimes they'd preserve the kid's…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.12,0:28:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放在玻璃箱里 放在墓冢里骨灰罐的旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}favorite toy in a glass case.Put it next to the headstone or crypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.30,0:28:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有发现什么奇怪的事情吗？- 我该从哪开始呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You notice anything strange here? - Uh, where do I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.22,0:28:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是这个意思 看看这些骨灰罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not what I mean.Look at the urns.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.10,0:28:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有四个母亲和三个孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there are only four. Yeah, mom and the three kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.36,0:29:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲的不在这放着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy Dearest isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.24,0:29:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.45,0:29:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你大哥在里面到底干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is your brother doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.00,0:29:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查看死亡证明文件 看能不能找到以赛亚的尸体哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Searching county death certificates.To learn what happened to lsaiah's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.88,0:29:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是怎么混进去的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd he even get in the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.46,0:29:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概撒撒谎 打打花枪之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lying and subterfuge, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.04,0:29:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有一个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.50,0:29:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你脸上粘了一根睫毛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have an eyelash on your…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.63,0:29:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your right-No. Uh, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.64,0:29:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你介意我 - 不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you mind if i? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.32,0:29:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.35,0:29:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.52,0:29:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}许个愿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.36,0:29:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨姆 能问你点事情吗？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, can I ask you something? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.76,0:29:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并不是想那么仓促 你知道女孩子是可以等上很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to be forward, but a girl could wait here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.20,0:29:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们之间是不是有什么火花 还是只是我自作多情而已？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something here between us? Or am I delusional?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.03,0:29:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是你在自作多情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.43,0:30:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是接下来还有个转折对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's a "but" coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.00,0:30:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是… 我不觉得这样是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't think this would be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.09,0:30:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能问为什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.43,0:30:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.06,0:30:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把我搞糊涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You lost me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.07,0:30:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这真的很难解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.44,0:30:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是我身边的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that when people are around me…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.69,0:30:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总是会受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, they get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.30,0:30:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你什么意思？- 我是指身体上受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - I mean, like, physically hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.99,0:30:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要关系到我和我大哥现在在做的事情实在是\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what my brother and I do, it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.07,0:30:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莎拉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾经有个女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}l had a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.84,0:30:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后来她去世了 我母亲也去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she died. And my mom died too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.04,0:30:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 反正就象…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, it's like…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.27,0:31:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就象是我被诅咒了一样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like l'm cursed or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.31,0:31:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就象死神总会出现在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like death just follows me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.85,0:31:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自己并不是很怕 可是如果我对某个人有感觉的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not scared of much. But if I let myself have feelings for anybody-
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.00,0:31:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你害怕她也会受到伤害对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scared they'd get hurt too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.44,0:31:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这样想真的很贴心 也很古板 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's very sweet. And very archaic. - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.18,0:31:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经是个大人了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. l'm a big girl, Sam.It's not your job…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.64,0:31:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不需要你来为我做什么决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make decisions for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.88,0:31:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人总是随时随地都可能会受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always a chance of getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.04,0:31:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是指伤心或是意外这类的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart and a tub of Hagen-Dazs.I'm not talking about a broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.05,0:31:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是指那些关乎生命危险的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.67,0:31:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可明天我也可能被公车撞倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow I could get hit by a bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.36,0:31:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生命正是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what life is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.51,0:31:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道失去挚爱的感觉很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. I know losing somebody you love, it's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.80,0:31:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把自己封闭起来 相信我 我知道是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut yourself off.Believe me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.34,0:31:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可当你把伤痛封闭起来的同时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when you shut out pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.32,0:31:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也封住了其他人对你的关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}you shut out everything else too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.06,0:31:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莎拉 你不明白 我所经历的那种伤痛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, you don't understand.The pain that I went through…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.87,0:31:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能再承受一次了 真的不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}l can't go through it again. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.78,0:31:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有打扰到你们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I interrupting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.54,0:31:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没有 - 一点也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.00,0:32:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 显而易见 - 你有查到什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh. Apparently. - So, what did you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.73,0:32:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有所收获 看来默钱特一家剩下的亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay dirt. The surviving relatives of the Merchant family…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.64,0:32:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都以以赛亚为耻 所以他们不想让他和家人同葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}were so ashamed of Isaiah, they didn't want him interred with the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.71,0:32:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他们把他的尸体交给郡里 郡里给了他穷人的葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They handed him over to the county.County gave him a pauper's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.30,0:32:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那种经济型的 所以他并没有被火化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Economy style. Turns out he wasn't cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.40,0:32:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是被装进了廉价的棺材\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was buried in a pine box.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.61,0:32:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我们得去烧他的尸骨 - 是有尸骨去烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So there are bones to burn. - There are bones to burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.01,0:32:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我你知道地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.84,0:32:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们看起来似乎 对这种事情出人意料的冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys seem to be uncomfortably comfortable with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.94,0:32:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种挖坟墓的事情我们不是头一回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this isn't exactly the first grave we've dug.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.47,0:32:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还觉得我是结婚的好对象吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still think l'm a catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.42,0:32:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挖到东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.41,0:33:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是作恶多端啊 Isaiah\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a real pain in the ass, Isaiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.49,0:33:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.47,0:33:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 不要熄火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the motor running.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.93,0:33:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为那幅画现在已经无害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the painting was harmless now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.10,0:33:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为保险起见 最好还是连画一起搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better safe than sorry We're gonna bury the sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.76,0:33:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我想和你一起去 - 你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanna come with you.You sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.50,0:33:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.27,0:33:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就待车上 你进去要采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay here, you go make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.90,0:33:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. l'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.13,0:34:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是鬼怪方面的专家 萨姆…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Sam, you're the expert on all this ghost stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.16,0:34:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这幅画应该是这样子的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that paintingsupposed to look like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.23,0:34:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}画中的小女孩哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.86,0:34:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有剃刀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the razor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.12,0:34:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 嘿 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Hey. ls that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.84,0:34:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.51,0:35:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 告诉我是你关的门 - 不是我 我想是那个小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me you slammed the door. - lt wasn't me. It was the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.76,0:35:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女孩？什么女孩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl? What girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.03,0:35:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 她不在画中了 - 我猜整件事都是她在搞鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's out of the painting.Might've been her all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.54,0:35:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲低头看的不是她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't the dad looking at her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.17,0:35:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 也许他是在试着警告我们- 我们稍后再说 先想办法出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe he was warning us. - Let's recap later, all right? Get us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.82,0:35:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正在撬锁 不过好象没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to pick the lock.Door won't budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.65,0:35:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 撞坏它 - 听着 天才 我去拿我的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then break it down. - Okay. Let me grab my battering ram.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.46,0:35:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迪恩 那鬼东西就要来了 - 我想出办法之前你要坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, it's coming. - Hold it off…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.75,0:35:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到什么盐和铁器之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I figure something.Get salt or iron. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.90,0:35:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这什么鬼房子竟然没有盐？你有找到什么铁器吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What house doesn't have salt?Low-sodium freaks. Find any iron?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.57,0:35:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没有 要拿来干吗？- 铁器能驱除鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. What's it for? - lron repels evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.65,0:35:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是必须是纯铁快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's got to be pure. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.28,0:35:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 再等会 别离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Dean. Give me a sec.Don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.38,0:35:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查看下椅子 有时候座位会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look in the chair.Sometimes the seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.73,0:36:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.09,0:36:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么做是不对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is just so wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.78,0:36:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}铁器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.24,0:36:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.16,0:36:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨姆 你没事吧？- 暂时没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sammy, you okay? - Yeah. For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.12,0:36:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们怎么消灭她？- 我不知道 她的尸骨已经被火化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How we gonna waste her? - I don't know. She was cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.87,0:36:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没什么可以拿来烧的 - 那她怎么还可能出现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing left to burn. - How's she still around?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.17,0:36:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定还有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.13,0:37:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 等等 之前我们在拍卖行里有出售古董娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, wait. We used to handle antique dolls at the auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.64,0:37:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可真不错 莎拉 干嘛现在才说这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fascinating, Sarah, but important right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.05,0:37:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那时候 娃娃的样子是照着夭折的孩子的样子做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, back then, they used to make the dolls in the kids' image.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.80,0:37:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说完全仿照 甚至会用上孩子的真头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, everything. Like they would use the kids' real hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.78,0:37:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 莎拉说那个娃娃可能植上了小女孩的头发？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Sarah says the doll might have the girl's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.77,0:37:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遗体残留和尸骨一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human remains. Same as bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.81,0:37:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那个墓冢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mausoleum.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.05,0:37:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 快起来 快起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! Come on, push! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.20,0:38:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真傻 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.35,0:38:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.53,0:39:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.52,0:40:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在郡里的档案里发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was archived in the county records.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.27,0:40:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}默钱特家收养的女儿梅兰妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Merchant's adopted daughter, Melanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.65,0:40:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道她为何被收养吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know why she was up for adoption?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.23,0:40:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为她自己的家人都在睡梦中被谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her real family was killed in their beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.98,0:40:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她杀了他们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.15,0:40:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 可是谁会去怀疑她？一个天真无邪的小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd suspect her? Sweet little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.32,0:40:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以接下来她也杀死了以赛亚全家 所以父亲会很自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}So then she kills lsaiah and his family.The old man takes the blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.24,0:40:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的灵魂从此也停留在画中 试着警告别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}His spirit's been trying to warn people ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.64,0:40:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这件要搬哪去？- 搬到后面去烧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's this one go? - Take it out back and burn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.29,0:40:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说真的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious, guys. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.34,0:40:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么那小女孩要做这种事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why'd the girl do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.55,0:40:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀了别人 然后再自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing others? Killing herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.01,0:40:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些人生来性格就扭曲 所以他们死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people are just born tortured.So when they die…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.15,0:40:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 灵魂也不会安息 - 可能就是那样 可是都不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …their spirits are just as dark. - Maybe. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.20,0:40:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都结束了 已经都搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over. We move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.89,0:40:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜这意味着你们要离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess this means you're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.69,0:40:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在车里等你 再会 莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go wait in the car. See you, Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.54,0:41:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才是那个烧毁了娃娃 消灭了恶鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who burned the doll…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.33,0:41:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摧毁其精神的人 竟然谢都不谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and destroyed the spirit, but don't thank me or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.21,0:41:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有很多话想对你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a million things that I want to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.71,0:41:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是此时此刻 我竟然想不到怎么去表达\N{\fnArial\fs30}but for the life of me I can't think of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.38,0:41:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也会想你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, l'll miss you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.42,0:41:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你知道 至少这件事情上我们都学到了东西 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, there's a lesson in all of this. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.49,0:41:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们共同经历的这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all got through this in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.56,0:41:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我也没有受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.31,0:41:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 我很高兴你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, l'm glad for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.52,0:41:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以也许不是你受诅咒了 也许吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe you're not cursed. Maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.70,0:41:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你有空可以回来看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'll come back and see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.71,0:41:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.96,0:42:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这才是我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boy.
